WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
The four adoption layers connect
through different integration paths.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.800
A copilot works with an engineer
in the development environment.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.960
A connected assistant reads pipeline
evidence and prepares a triage brief.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:15.840
A bounded agent can use approved
tools in an isolated scope and propose

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.840
a change. Shared platform
services supply context,

00:00:19.909 --> 00:00:23.200
models, evaluation
and execution to all three.

00:00:23.344 --> 00:00:26.240
They are not four
consecutive runtime steps.

00:00:26.313 --> 00:00:30.320
Independent checks and accountable
owners remain across every path.
